Disable the scale boxes while the scale box is clear

The image dialog held the two scale spin boxes writable while the scale
check box was clear. The dialog reports a width and a height of zero in
that state. A user could type a size, accept the dialog and lose the
typed value, because the dialog gave no sign of the loss.

Follow the check box with the enable state of the scale controls. Set
that state each time the dialog takes a configuration.

The change sits on the branch work/image-dialog of the local tree, as commit 2 of 5.
A new merge request on system/qtcurve takes that branch.

Drop this patch when upstream merges the change.

diff --git a/qt6/config/imagepropertiesdialog.cpp b/qt6/config/imagepropertiesdialog.cpp
